    {
      "n": 1,
      "signpost": null,
      "definition": "not often",
      "explanation": "**Seldom** means the same as **rarely** but is a little more formal and more common in writing. It usually comes before the main verb and after **be**. When it opens a sentence, the verb comes before the subject (*Seldom have I seen such a view*); this is formal and mostly written.",
      "grammar": {
        "countability": null,
        "transitivity": null,
